            "text": "<ul><li>High Levels of Flavonoids and Terpenoids</li><li>Improved Cognitive Function</li><li>Promotes Blood Circulation in the Brain</li><li>Protects the Brain from Neuronal Damage</li></ul><p>Used in Asian countries for thousands of years, antioxidant-rich herb Ginkgo Biloba is derived from one of the true living fossils in history, of which examples have been found from 280 million years ago. There is a myriad of uses described throughout history, but most notably is the research backed idea of improved blood perfusion to the entire body, but most specifically to the brain. Reductions in anxiety and mental clarity have been described for centuries as well as improving vascular and other associated dementias. Hi-Tech Pharmaceuticals Ginkgo Biloba contains numerous flavonoids which some science suggests can protect against aging-related issues such as dementia by improving blood flow to the brain.<br/><br/>For more information of Hi-Tech's proprietary Cyclosome Technology - visit<br/><a href=\"http://cyclosometechnology.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://cyclosometechnology.com/</a></p>"
