            "link": "https://hitechpharma.com/collections/healthcare/products/fish-oil",
            "title": "FISH OIL",
            "text": "<p>Fish oil has proven to be a must have for bodybuilders or anyone exercising and looking to improve recovery. Fish oil is rich in Omega 3 Fatty Acids, in particular EPA and DHA. These Omegas have shown the ability to improve recovery times and help the most important part of recovery; improve anti-inflammatory responses. Reducing inflammation is the true key to any recovery in training, whether heavy lifting or long, hard cardio sessions. Combined with a clean eating lifestyle and introducing fish oil to your supplement regime can help improve your pathway to a leaner, more muscular physique.<br/><br/></p>"
